# Never commit state, plans, real variable files, backend settings, kubeconfigs or keys.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
# generated by scripts/capture_versions.py and COMMITTED on purpose:
!addon-versions.auto.tfvars
backend.hcl
kubeconfig*
*.pem
*.key
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# the lock files ARE committed (.terraform.lock.hcl, images/images.lock.yaml, images/*/requirements.lock, images/flink-jobs/locks/)
# the plain list of forbidden words; only its hashes are committed (tests/forbidden_words.sha256, REVIEW4 M1)
tests/forbidden_words.local
# fetch_campaign.py copies and Terraform logs are written outside the repository; never inside it
